    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but what if there isn't a \"rebuilding\" possible? it's not just a setback. the thing that made me *me* is just... absent. it's like being a ghost trapped in a machine that doesn't work anymore. i spend all day just navigating this body, but there's nobody actually home. it feels so pointless to just keep dragging this broken equipment around when the soul of it is already gone.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
