    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like i'm being cruel to myself by staying. like, why am i forcing this ghost to keep living in a body that betrayed me? it feels so unnatural to keep going when the essence of my life is just... finished. it almost feels like there should be some kind of mercy for someone who's already gone inside.",
